        "book": "Philippians",
        "chapter": 1,
        "verse": 1
      },
      {
        "text": "Grace be unto you, and peace, from God our Father, and from the Lord Jesus Christ.",
        "footNotes": [],
        "italics": [
          {
            "start": 6,
            "end": 8
          },
          {
            "start": 55,
            "end": 59
          }
        ],
        "associatedContent": [],
        "verseNumber": 2,
        "crossReferences": [],
        "jstReferences": [],
        "reference": "Philippians 1:2",
        "book": "Philippians",
        "chapter": 1,
        "verse": 2
      },
      {
        "text": "I thank my God upon every remembrance of you,",
        "footNotes": [],
        "italics": [],
        "associatedContent": [],
        "verseNumber": 3,
        "crossReferences": [],
        "jstReferences": [],
        "reference": "Philippians 1:3",
        "book": "Philippians",
        "chapter": 1,
        "verse": 3
      },
      {
        "text": "Always in every prayer of mine for you all making request with joy,",
        "footNotes": [],
        "italics": [],
        "associatedContent": [],
        "verseNumber": 4,
        "crossReferences": [],
        "jstReferences": [],
        "reference": "Philippians 1:4",
        "book": "Philippians",
        "chapter": 1,
        "verse": 4
      },
      {
        "text": "For your fellowship in the gospel from the first day until now;",
        "footNotes": [],
        "italics": [],
        "associatedContent": [],
        "verseNumber": 5,
        "crossReferences": [],
        "jstReferences": [],
        "reference": "Philippians 1:5",
        "book": "Philippians",
        "chapter": 1,
        "verse": 5
      },
      {
        "text": "Being confident of this very thing, that he which hath begun a good work in you will perform it until the day of Jesus Christ:",
        "footNotes": [
          {
            "start": 85,
            "end": 92,
            "text": "GR complete, accomplish."
          }
        ],
        "italics": [
          {
            "start": 93,
            "end": 95
          }
        ],
        "associatedContent": [],
        "verseNumber": 6,
        "crossReferences": [],
        "jstReferences": [],
        "reference": "Philippians 1:6",
        "book": "Philippians",
        "chapter": 1,
        "verse": 6
      },
      {
        "text": "Even as it is meet for me to think this of you all, because I have you in my heart; inasmuch as both in my bonds, and in the defence and confirmation of the gospel, ye all are partakers of my grace.",
        "footNotes": [
          {
            "start": 14,
            "end": 18,
            "text": "GR just, right."
          },
          {
            "start": 137,
            "end": 149,
            "text": "GR establishment, strengthening."
          },
          {
            "start": 192,
            "end": 197,
            "text": "TG Grace."
          }
        ],
        "italics": [],
        "associatedContent": [],
        "verseNumber": 7,
        "crossReferences": [
          {
            "raw": "TG Grace.",
            "prettyString": "TG Grace",
            "references": [
              {
                "type": "studyHelp",
                "studyHelpType": "tg",
                "title": "Grace",
                "entryId": "tg-grace",
                "book": "",
                "chapters": []
              }
            ]
          }
        ],
        "jstReferences": [],
        "reference": "Philippians 1:7",
        "book": "Philippians",
        "chapter": 1,
        "verse": 7
      },
      {
        "text": "For God is my record, how greatly I long after you all in the bowels of Jesus Christ.",
        "footNotes": [
          {
            "start": 14,
            "end": 20,
            "text": "GR witness."
          },
          {
            "start": 62,
            "end": 68,
            "text": "GR affections, compassions."
          }
        ],
        "italics": [],
        "associatedContent": [],
        "verseNumber": 8,
        "crossReferences": [],
        "jstReferences": [],
        "reference": "Philippians 1:8",
        "book": "Philippians",
        "chapter": 1,
        "verse": 8
      },
      {
        "text": "And this I pray, that your love may abound yet more and more in knowledge and in all judgment;",
        "footNotes": [
          {
            "start": 27,
            "end": 31,
            "text": "Moses 7:18."
          }
        ],
        "italics": [
          {
            "start": 78,
            "end": 80
          }
        ],
        "associatedContent": [],
        "verseNumber": 9,
        "crossReferences": [
          {
            "raw": "Moses 7:18.",
            "prettyString": "Moses 7:18",
            "references": [
              {
                "type": "scripture",
                "book": "moses",
                "chapters": [
                  {
                    "start": 7,
                    "end": 7,
                    "verses": [
                      {
                        "start": 18,
                        "end": 18
                      }
                    ]
                  }
                ]
              }
            ]
          }
        ],
        "jstReferences": [],
        "reference": "Philippians 1:9",
        "book": "Philippians",
        "chapter": 1,
        "verse": 9
      },
      {
        "text": "That ye may approve things that are excellent; that ye may be sincere and without offence till the day of Christ;",
        "footNotes": [
          {
            "start": 12,
            "end": 19,
            "text": "GR prove, put to the test."
          },
          {
            "start": 62,
            "end": 69,
            "text": "GR pure, spotless."
          }
        ],
        "italics": [],
        "associatedContent": [],
        "verseNumber": 10,
        "crossReferences": [],
        "jstReferences": [],
        "reference": "Philippians 1:10",
        "book": "Philippians",
        "chapter": 1,
        "verse": 10
      },
      {
        "text": "Being filled with the fruits of righteousness, which are by Jesus Christ, unto the glory and praise of God.",
        "footNotes": [
          {
            "start": 32,
            "end": 45,
            "text": "TG Righteousness."
          }
        ],
        "italics": [],
        "associatedContent": [],
        "verseNumber": 11,
        "crossReferences": [
          {
            "raw": "TG Righteousness.",
            "prettyString": "TG Righteousness",
            "references": [
              {
                "type": "studyHelp",
                "studyHelpType": "tg",
                "title": "Righteousness",
                "entryId": "tg-righteousness",
                "book": "",
                "chapters": []
              }
            ]
          }
        ],
        "jstReferences": [],
        "reference": "Philippians 1:11",
        "book": "Philippians",
        "chapter": 1,
        "verse": 11
      },
      {
        "text": "But I would ye should understand, brethren, that the things which happened unto me have fallen out rather unto the furtherance of the gospel;",
        "footNotes": [
          {
            "start": 88,
            "end": 98,
            "text": "GR come."
          }
        ],
        "italics": [
          {
            "start": 60,
            "end": 74
          }
        ],
        "associatedContent": [],
        "verseNumber": 12,
        "crossReferences": [],
        "jstReferences": [],
        "reference": "Philippians 1:12",
        "book": "Philippians",
        "chapter": 1,
        "verse": 12
      },
      {
        "text": "So that my bonds in Christ are manifest in all the palace, and in all other places;",
        "footNotes": [
          {
            "start": 51,
            "end": 57,
            "text": "Philip. 4:22."
          }
        ],
        "italics": [
          {
            "start": 76,
            "end": 83
          }
        ],
        "associatedContent": [],
        "verseNumber": 13,
