        "jstReferences": [],
        "reference": "Philippians 1:13",
        "book": "Philippians",
        "chapter": 1,
        "verse": 13
      },
      {
        "text": "And many of the brethren in the Lord, waxing confident by my bonds, are much more bold to speak the word without fear.",
        "footNotes": [
          {
            "start": 113,
            "end": 117,
            "text": "Luke 1:74 (68–75); 1 Jn. 4:18 (15–18); D&C 68:6 (5–6)."
          }
        ],
        "italics": [],
        "associatedContent": [],
        "verseNumber": 14,
        "crossReferences": [],
        "jstReferences": [],
        "reference": "Philippians 1:14",
        "book": "Philippians",
        "chapter": 1,
        "verse": 14
      },
      {
        "text": "Some indeed preach Christ even of envy and strife; and some also of good will:",
        "footNotes": [
          {
            "start": 43,
            "end": 49,
            "text": "TG Strife."
          }
        ],
        "italics": [],
        "associatedContent": [],
        "verseNumber": 15,
        "crossReferences": [
          {
            "raw": "TG Strife.",
            "prettyString": "TG Strife",
            "references": [
              {
                "type": "studyHelp",
                "studyHelpType": "tg",
