        "jstReferences": [],
        "reference": "Philippians 1:27",
        "book": "Philippians",
        "chapter": 1,
        "verse": 27
      },
      {
        "text": "And in nothing terrified by your adversaries: which is to them an evident token of perdition, but to you of salvation, and that of God.",
        "footNotes": [
          {
            "start": 46,
            "end": 54,
            "text": "JST Philip. 1:28 … who reject the gospel, which bringeth on them destruction; but you who receive the gospel, salvation; and that of God."
          }
